  "metaDescription": "President Prabowo Subianto attended the 2026 National Teacher Day in Bogor, pledging future salary increases and announcing new training opportunities.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "President Prabowo Subianto attended the 2026 National Teacher Day commemoration held at the Sentul International Convention Center in Bogor.",
    "The administration announced plans to send over 3,300 teachers for international training in Canada and Russia starting in 2027.",
    "Official commitments included prioritizing teacher allowances totaling over Rp90 trillion and developing new distance learning infrastructure."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "During the 2026 National Teacher Day ceremony in Bogor, West Java, President Prabowo Subianto delivered an address acknowledging the contributions of educators across Indonesia. While the President did not immediately implement salary hikes, he stated that improving teacher compensation remains a future priority for his administration, noting that total allowances for teachers exceed Rp90 trillion. The event also highlighted specific initiatives to support the workforce, including the development of a 'Teacher Studio' for distance education and plans to facilitate international training programs for 3,350 teachers in Canada and Russia beginning in 2027. Additionally, the government addressed ongoing discussions regarding the recruitment of civil servants, with lawmakers urging the swift issuance of technical regulations for non-ASN teachers over the age of 35. The Ministry of Basic and Secondary Education continues to oversee certification and employment transition processes for honorarium staff.",
